begin="36.310" end="36.522">when</span> <span begin="36.522" end="36.976">you</span> <span begin="36.976" end="37.453">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="37.453" end="37.841">know</span> <span begin="37.841" end="38.349">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="38.349" end="39.854">beautiful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为你美而不自知</span></p><p begin="40.085" end="43.749" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.085" end="40.190">And</span> <span begin="40.190" end="40.309">I</span> <span begin="40.309" end="40.641">won&apos;t</span> <span begin="40.641" end="40.876">let</span> <span begin="40.876" end="41.268">it</span> <span begin="41.268" end="42.248">go</span> <span begin="42.424" end="43.749">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我绝不会放手</span></p><p begin="43.987" end="45.686" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.987" end="44.204">I</span> <span begin="44.204" end="44.439">need</span> <span begin="44.439" end="44.797">you</span> <span begin="44.797" end="44.979">to</span> <span begin="44.979" end="45.686">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你明白</span></p><p begin="46.071" end="51.931" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.071" end="47.066">That</span> <span begin="47.066" end="48.088">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="48.088" end="48.984">my</span> <span begin="48.984" end="50.900">pret</span><span begin="50.900" end="51.931">ty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我的挚爱</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="51.872" end="55.101"><span begin="51.872" end="55.101">(Oh)</span></span></p><p begin="54.996" end="59.724" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.996" end="55.220">De</span><span begin="55.220" end="55.731">fini</span><span begin="55.731" end="56.137">tion</span> <span begin="56.137" end="56.534">of</span> <span begin="56.534" end="58.433">beau</span><span begin="58.433" end="59.724">ty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我心目中的美人</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="59.503" end="1:02.716"><span begin="59.503" end="1:02.716">(Oh)</span></span></p><p begin="1:02.856" end="1:06.041" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.856" end="1:03.297">And</span> <span begin="1:03.297" end="1:03.728">out</span> <span begin="1:03.728" end="1:04.214">of</span> <span begin="1:04.214" end="1:04.904">everything</span> <span begin="1:04.904" end="1:05.222">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:05.222" end="1:06.041">seen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">世间万千风景</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:05.203" end="1:07.149"><span begin="1:05.203" end="1:05.856">(Everything</span> <span begin="1:05.856" end="1:06.150">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:06.150" end="1:07.149">seen)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遍览群芳</span></span></p><p begin="1:06.202" end="1:10.885" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.202" end="1:06.468">Nothing</span> <span begin="1:06.468" end="1:06.765">can</span> <span begin="1:06.765" end="1:07.781">compete</span> <span begin="1:07.781" end="1:08.043">with</span> <span begin="1:08.043" end="1:10.885">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都不及你半分绮丽</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:07.128" end="1:08.433"><span begin="1:07.128" end="1:07.460">(Nothing</span> <span begin="1:07.460" end="1:07.763">can</span> <span begin="1:07.763" end="1:08.433">compete)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无与伦比</span></span></p><p begin="1:10.816" end="1:16.230" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.816" end="1:11.856">My</span> <span begin="1:11.856" end="1:13.906">pret</span><span begin="1:13.906" end="1:16.230">ty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的挚爱</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:10.930" end="1:16.389"><span begin="1:10.930" end="1:16.389">(Oh)</span></span></p><p begin="1:27.794" end="1:30.382" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.794" end="1:28.060">Yeah</span> <span begin="1:28.060" end="1:28.189">the</span> <span begin="1:28.189" end="1:28.469">sun</span> <span begin="1:28.469" end="1:28.777">has</span> <span begin="1:28.777" end="1:29.085">good</span> <span begin="1:29.085" end="1:30.382">taste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连太阳也那么有品位</span></p><p begin="1:30.984" end="1:32.666" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.984" end="1:31.115">He&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:31.115" end="1:31.620">peeking</span> <span begin="1:31.620" end="1:31.877">through</span> <span begin="1:31.877" end="1:32.030">the</span> <span begin="1:32.030" end="1:32.666">blinders</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">竟然透过百叶窗的缝隙流连</span></p><p begin="1:32.893" end="1:35.368" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.893" end="1:33.243">Just</span> <span begin="1:33.243" end="1:33.460">to</span> <span begin="1:33.460" end="1:33.733">get</span> <span begin="1:33.733" end="1:33.865">a</span> <span begin="1:33.865" end="1:34.349">glimpse</span> <span begin="1:34.349" end="1:34.522">of</span> <span begin="1:34.522" end="1:34.900">your</span> <span begin="1:34.900" end="1:35.368">face</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为窥见你惊鸿一面</span></p><p begin="1:35.525" end="1:38.371" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.525" end="1:35.651">And</span> <span begin="1:35.651" end="1:35.805">he</span> <span begin="1:35.805" end="1:36.468">traveled</span> <span begin="1:36.468" end="1:36.651">quite</span> <span begin="1:36.651" end="1:36.743">a</span> <span begin="1:36.743" end="1:38.371">ways</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他跋山涉水</span></p><p begin="1:38.752" end="1:43.001" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.752" end="1:39.235">Ninety</span> <span begin="1:39.235" end="1:39.661">million</span> <span begin="1:39.661" end="1:40.061">miles</span> <span begin="1:40.061" end="1:40.159">to</span> <span begin="1:40.159" end="1:40.47